{
  "about": "Component-selection cases for scripts/ui/ui_select.py, run by tests/ui-skill-routing.test.sh against the tests/fixtures/ui-select-repo UIToolkit fixture (tag v0.8.0, client pinned to #v0.8.0). Each case runs `ui_select.py --json` with `--need <need>` or `--screen <screen>`. status_in: allowed statuses; choice_contains: regexes (re.search) the JSON of the choice must match; owner_in: allowed owner_if_missing. A screen case asserts the choices_contain regexes over all of its selections and that none of its needs is missing.",
  "needs": [
